window.products.push({"id":409034,"name":"Ivenf Christmas Stockings, 4 Pcs 18 inches Red and Black Buffalo Check Plaid with Burlap Stockings, for Family Holiday Xmas Party Decorations Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yW5vs3EKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ORIGINAL DESIGN. 4 pack of two different design. Definitely a perfect addition to your Christmas decorations and home decorations. RUSTIC FEEL. Quality burlap feel materials with buffalo plaid. Add a natural & festive vibe to your holiday decor. STRONG & DURABLE. Double layer lining design. Thick & sturdy. Last for years to come. Ready to be stuffed with goodies gifts for whole family. EXTRA LARGE 18\" SIZE. Each Christmas stocking has a 3-1/2\" ribbon hang loop for easy display. 20-1/2\" diagonal at widest point. Top opening is 7-1/2\" wide. You may add names on the top and toe by writing, embroider or glitter glue. Customize them into unique stockings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yW5vs3EKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ivenf","source_asin":"B08BC42T6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409034","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BC42T6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BC42T6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409035,"name":"Presto 05411 GranPappy Electric Deep Fryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710xuniOwlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Delicious deep fried foods - fast and easy! Uses just six cups of oil and maintains perfect frying temperature automatically. Snap-on lid stores oil to use again and again. 120 volts, 60 Hz only Amazon.com In the homespun days, food was usually fried in a big cast-iron metal pot. But modern times demand simpler solutions. The Presto GranPappy electric deep fryer fits on a countertop and is so easy to use. Just add oil, plug it in, and in 15 minutes it's heated up and ready to fry. Its sleek, black bucket shape matches form to function-- simple and classic. The GranPappy holds up to six cups of oil or three pounds of shortening, and it can accommodate up to six servings of food at a time. The internal thermostat keeps the oil at the optimum frying temperature. An accompanying scoop, slotted for draining, is for lifting food in and out or for turning food halfway through the cooking time. The power cord has a magnetic safety connection, so that if the unit is jostled during cooking, the cord will disconnect, shutting power off immediately. After straining the used oil, it can be poured back into the unit and stored, covered by the accompanying snap-on plastic lid. After frying, unplug the unit and allow it to cool completely before attempting to empty oil. Wash the GranPappy with warm, sudsy water and dry it thoroughly; it is not immersible. To preserve the nonstick finish, inside and out, do not use steel wool or harsh, abrasive cleansers. The Presto GranPappy measures 8 by 8-1/2 inches. Presto guarantees this product with a one-year limited warranty. A simple instruction and recipe sheet is enclosed. --Garland Withers From the Manufacturer Sporting a fresh look, this stylish deep fryer is super for sizzling up crunchy chicken, golden French fries, crispy onion rings, and more. It quickly fries six liberal servings with only six cups of oil. The perfect frying temperature is maintained automatically. The fryer is constructed of heavy-cast aluminum and features a nonstick surface, inside and out, for no-hassle cleaning. A snap-on lid allows oil to be stored in the fryer to use again. Slotted scoop included. One-year limited warranty. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710xuniOwlS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Presto","source_asin":"B0000Z6JK0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000Z6JK0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000Z6JK0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409036,"name":"Wilmax WL-880108, 12 oz. Julia Collection White Porcelain Mugs, Classic European Bone China Hot Drinks Coffee Tea Mug/Cup, Gift Box Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21DtE8huL+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Wilmax WL-880108, 12 oz. Julia Collection White Porcelain Mugs, Classic European Bone China Hot Drinks Coffee Tea Mug/Cup, Gift Box Set of 2 have a distinctive universal plain design of Julia collection that can fit almost any interior, from classical to futuristic one. Made from sturdy porcelain and covered with solid, impeccably white glaze, it will ensure the best presentation of hot dinks, tea, coffee, latte, which you offer to your guests. Its scratch- and chip-resistant finish will not lose its shiny look after years of intensive use. Microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe, this dinnerware offers superior flexibility and comfort in use. A great solution for festive occasions, afternoon tea or everyday meals, for home or commercial grade application!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21DtE8huL+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wilmax","source_asin":"B01M0L0S3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M0L0S3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M0L0S3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
