window.products.push({"id":409175,"name":"ZHONGJINGYAN Custom Canvas Wall Decor with Your Photo on Canvas Print Wall Art Personalized Memorial Gift (30\"x30\" (75x75cm) No Frame)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618tBYnPcGL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Personalized Custom: We offer canvas prints service made from your photo. Fine workmanship and materials are the guarantee of quality. Customized your personalized artwork, let your family more warm and comfortable, enjoy the praise of guests. We will combine your precious memories in the photo, create a sighted and unique wall ornament. NOTE: The final printing effect is consistent with the preview you see in the Amazon custom button. When upload photo, Please make sure the photos covers the entire canvas area. pick the RIGHT SIZE that matches your photo. For best picture quality, upload your picture in \"JPEG\" file format, and high resolution image must be at least 75 DPI. Digital camera resolution must be 4 megapixels minimum. No Frame: This customized artwork only canvas! We use high-quality environmental ink printing in high-quality canvas, waterproof, anti-UV line, not easy to fade. We default to leave 3cm white border per canvas. The blank space is convenient for your to Install frame. If you don't need a white border, please contact us. Custom Wall Decor: Unique wall art decor for home, living room, bedroom, bathroom, dining room, kitchen etc. Suitable for Family, Aging Kids with Wedding Photos Graduation Pictures and Vacation Mementos on Christmas, birthday, Valentine's Day or other important occasions. Personalized Gifts: Special gift give her/him gifts for woman, men, wife, mom, dad, boyfriend, fiance, friend, husband, partner. The personalized canvas wall art is a unique way of expressing your love for one who you valued. Good Service: We promise to provide the best customer service for each customer to ensure that our customers can rest assured to buy. If you have any questions about this printed photos, please contact us, we will solve or refund for you within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618tBYnPcGL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZHONGJINGYAN","source_asin":"B09PG1TTVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PG1TTVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PG1TTVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409176,"name":"WYZworks Foam Flower (12 Pack) Kissing Ball Pomander Ivory White 6\" with Realistic Floral Rose Leaf Details for Wedding Decoration Centerpieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWNmqJPgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfectly round foam flower pomander adds an elegant and enchanting touch to any event. Decorate your wedding reception, ceremony, aisle, table centerpieces, venue decor or dress up your bridesmaids and/or flower girl with the attached satin loop handle. These flower balls prove quite versatile for all sorts of events. Easily reuse them as the foam material retains their shape and will always be perfectly round.  Each rose petal comes with ridge details to mimic rose leaf details. Specifications: Color: Ivory White Material: Foam Rose Ball Diameter: 18\" / 45.72cm Satin Loop Handle: Approx 8\" Long","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sWNmqJPgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WYZworks","source_asin":"B0195RPYAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409176","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0195RPYAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0195RPYAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409177,"name":"GWPP Melamine Plastic Bowl with Lid and Handle, Square, Set of 3 assorted sizes, for Food Storage. B9908 (Green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zciWYRFpL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Package: (1) Small bowl with Lid：7-1/4\"（length） x 5-7/8\"（width） x 3-1/8\"（deep） (1) Medium bowl with Lid：8-1/2“（length）x 6-7/8\"（width） x 3-5/8\"（deep） (1) Large bowl with Lid：9-3/5\"（length） x 7-7/8\"（width） x 3-3/4\"（deep） Features of melamine products: The quality is safety for put food on it. Smooth, beautiful and generous.  Melamine dinnerware look like ceramic but unbreakable, and you don't worry about breakage on the way to camper or travel.  Melmac plastic tableware is BPA free. The quality is safe for put food on it. Smooth, beautiful and generous.  DO NOT using for microwave. Melamine (Melmac) tablewares are oil resistant and organic solvents.  They are not easy to be dyed. Suitable for most detergent available in the market. Melmac products manufacture by high pressure and temperature, safety temperature less than 158℉. Non breakable dishware, not easy to damage, durable, and can be used for many times, re-use greatly saving operating costs. Melamine products is healthy non-toxic tasteless, Approvel for US FDA standards ensure all product is safety for using. Can be used in dishwashers, but microwave ovens, ovens should not be used, electronic disinfection cabinet should be used with caution. The melamine products are more environmentally friendly than the old porcelain products and do not cause any pollution when placed in the natural environment.   About cleaning methods: Washing should be placed at the top of the dishwasher. Dishwasher safety for setting less than 158℉. When you clean tableware, please use soft cleaning tools are suggested to be used for cleaning, such as sponges, cotton cloth, etc. DO NOT use steel ball and other harder washing tools to clean the Melamine dinnware.  Cusomize Product Design Service:  You can order special tableware for your family or resautant, justsend message to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zciWYRFpL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M&B GWPP","source_asin":"B07GQQYV4D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GQQYV4D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GQQYV4D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409178,"name":"Heartbeats Of The Wild by Marion Rose, 35x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":121.56,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TnFOVuDDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a bear holding a fish over a lake. Most days, one would find Marion Rose putting on her favorite music or playing an old video before settling in to paint for the day in her spacious studio, especially once the winter chill set in. Her work is influenced by past masters such as Joaquin Sorolla, Tom Thomson, Carl Rungius, Bob Kuhn, and many others that work today in a variety of subject and media. She also studied printmaking, life painting and drawing in college in her 30's. Her subjects come from her life of traveling enthusiastically as often as she could, both close to home or across the ocean. Sketching and studying animals were a favorite pastime, setting an excellent foundation for creating authentic work. Texture and richly colored paint applied generously by knife or brush strokes capture the essence of a subject's spirit and demeanor. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TnFOVuDDL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B0711T8T9M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0711T8T9M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0711T8T9M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
