window.products.push({"id":409368,"name":"MALOUF Bedding Essentials Kit - Bed in a Bag - Includes One Pillow, Comforter and Sheet Set - Twin XL","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYq-CNJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bed in a BagThe bed in a bag is a bedding essentials kit perfect for those who are getting a new sized bed, moving, or starting a new phase of life. Save yourself time and money by getting the bed in a bag. The set has three main components: one gelled MicrofiberA pillow, microfiber sheets, and a down-alternative comforter.one Down-Alternative PillowThe down-alternative gelled MicrofiberA pillows have all the benefits of down without the sharp quills, inconsistent fill, and .Super Soft SheetsThe brushed microfiber sheets are the perfect mix of luxury and practicality. The micro-yarn structure produces a soft, breathable weave that is stain and wrinkle resistant. Brushing the microfiber creates a fabric that is softer and more durable than most cotton. Microfibers are 100 times thinner than a strand of hair which prevent from collecting in the material.Cozy ComforterThe down-alternative comforter is a treat to cuddle up in. The soft polyester shell is filled with gel coated microfibers. Coating the microfibers in gel helps the fibers slip past each other for a more consistent down-like fill. Twin xl sheet set: 1 flat sheet (69 x 102) 1 fitted sheet (39 x 80) and 1 queen size pillowcase (20 x 30) duvet cover: twin duvet (68 x 86) pillows: one standard pillow (25 x 16).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wYq-CNJOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MALOUF","source_asin":"B00G4MCQMS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G4MCQMS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G4MCQMS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
