window.products.push({"id":409427,"name":"Soju Shot Glasses, 1oz Unique Shot Glasses Set of 2/Special Tequila Glasses/Port Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e-3S1Ui8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is a unique shot glass that you can use to drink your favorite tequila. If you want to make a special tequila, please choose it, it will always be refreshing.It is an interesting object whether on the table or decoration. In China this unique cup is called the Emperor Shot Glasses, an ancient drinking vessel for the use of the emperor and aristocracy. This shot glass imitating the ancient emperor's shot glass, adding new design elements to make it more interesting. This unique shot glass is a great gift idea for your friends. For those who enjoy Chinese culture I highly recommend it whether you want a cool drinking cup or just a conversation piece on a shelf. These shot glasses are well-made and functional making it perfect for consistent use. Made out of lead free glass, food grade safe glass and dishwasher safe, these shot glasses are the good choice for drinking! Size: 3.35x3.15x2.16 Inches Size: 3.35x3.15x2.16 Inches Volume: 30ml, 1oz. Volume: 30ml, 1oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e-3S1Ui8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEYUT","source_asin":"B083LVW6PH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409427","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083LVW6PH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083LVW6PH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409428,"name":"Semtomn Tapestry Artwork Wall Hanging Sober Funny Black and White Drinking Humor Saying 50x60 Inches Home Decor Tapestries Mattress Tablecloth Curtain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtMR+ti1L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"HD printing It can be machine washed, washed in cold water, washed separately and dried in the air. Chlorine bleach is not recommended. Applicable scenarios: Perfect for walls, beds, sofas, etc. Use this beautiful wall mounted, university dormitory decoration to illuminate any space. It is also a surprise gift for housewarming, special festivals and birthdays. Tapestries are easy to hang. Use decorative nails, pushpins, pushpins or Velcro straps (excluding suspension devices!) Package includes: a beautiful tapestry Due to manual measurement, please allow a size difference of 1-2 cm. Please note: due to different light and screen display, the image and product may be slightly different.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FtMR+ti1L._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Semtomn","source_asin":"B07RPL4K1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RPL4K1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RPL4K1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409429,"name":"Lipper International 1260 Acacia Supreme End Grain Cutting and Carving Board with Juice Groove, 24\" x 16\" x 1\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dS1nykfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This supremely sized board is ready for anything you can throw at it in the kitchen. Brisket? Making tomato sauce? Chopping up veggies for a salad that serves 10? Size isn’t everything of course, the end grain construction is gentler on knives and is routinely recommended by professional chefs. This beautifully made board is the perfect thing to use as a statement piece in your kitchen. Great for serving charcuterie spreads for larger groups either indoors or out. To keep it reasonably light enough to handle it’s 1” thick, but still has a juice groove with a 6oz capacity. 100% acacia hardwood means this durable end grain board is ready to be a family favorite for years to come. Hand wash with a mild soap and cool water. Do not soak. Do not put in the dishwasher, microwave or refrigerator. Extreme changes in temperature will cause the material to crack over time. Dry thoroughly. Occasional use of mineral oil will help maintain appearance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dS1nykfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lipper International","source_asin":"B0928MBKHG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928MBKHG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928MBKHG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
