window.products.push({"id":409472,"name":"Victoria 14-Inch Cast-Iron Wok with Loop Handles, Preseasoned with Flaxseed Oil, Made in Colombia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5nJ4UkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CAST-IRON COOKING: Our high-quality Cast-Iron Wok comes with a perfectly textured preseasoned skin that helps build seasoning with each use and offers an easier release. We use only non-GMO, kosher-certified flaxseed oil to season it, and it’s free of PTFE and PFOA for healthier cooking. MADE FOR GREAT MEALS: Our Cast-Iron Wok pan was designed with the user in mind. It features 2 large ergonomic loop handles; has a flat, wide base for more even cooking and stability; and has a holding capacity of about 5 L to hold all your favorite dishes. EASY TO USE: Give your cooking an upgrade by using cast-iron cookware. Durable, rugged, and made to last, our Cast-Iron Wok allows the perfect amount of heat, steam, and moisture flow for more evenly cooked food. With a few easy steps, our stove-top cooking wok will last a lifetime. VERSATILE POT: Our Cast-Iron Wok is made with natural materials and can be used almost anywhere, such as on the stove, on induction cooktops, in the oven, over a campfire, or on a grill. Your food will stay warm for longer and will be infused with beneficial natural iron. FROM STOVE TO TABLE: Victoria has manufactured quality cast-iron cookware in our own factories in Colombia—never outsourcing—since 1939. Our cast-iron products are made with resource-efficient materials, are economical, outlast traditional cookware, and offer reliable cooking for years to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a5nJ4UkmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Victoria","source_asin":"B01IB8GGSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IB8GGSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IB8GGSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
