window.products.push({"id":409480,"name":"Deny Designs Jacqueline Maldonado Rapt Shower Curtain, 69\" x 72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":82.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917AvhtMuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who says bathrooms can't be fun? To get the most bang for your buck, start with an artistic, inventive shower curtain. This woven polyester shower curtain features a vibrant printed front and white back and includes 12 buttonhole openings at the top (rings not included). While water resistant, we recommend using a clear shower curtain liners for best results (liner not included). Based in Denver, Colorado, Deny Designs is a modern, think-outside-the-box home furnishings company. Deny empowers its customers to transform dull, everyday household accessories into fun and original statement. With each purchase, our team of talented artists earn part of the proceeds, enabling Deny to support art communities all over the world while also spreading the creative love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917AvhtMuUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B008AJK8QO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409480","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008AJK8QO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008AJK8QO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
