window.products.push({"id":409499,"name":"Genuine Rose Quartz Crystal Decorative String Lights Raw Stone Color Changing 8.5ft 20 LEDs USB Plug in Battery Operated with Remote for Bedroom Chakr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iC8sYqYOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Beauty and Energy from Pale Pink Healing Stone】Natural and Untreated Directly from the Quartz Mine. Each stone is embedded with two chips of different light colors. The colors of different intensities combined into different colors. Each stone can emit multiple colors. The stones are light up from inside like magic crystal from mythical world, bringing mysterious and pleasant atmosphere to real life. It could be a great additional touch for you to feel nice and cozy. 【Varies in Size and Colors】All stones are naturally generated and picked by hand, We try to keep its original wild appearance as much as we can. Size of each stone varies from 0.8-1.5-inch, Approximate weight: 8-12 g. The wire is barely noticeable and Could be easily hid. The stones are chosen carefully, washed and embellished before putting together. 【Use USB Plug In to Be Environment Friendly, Battery Pack Included】The string of lights are connected to an USB hub to work with an charger, you could save the trouble of purchasing and changing batteries. Low voltage makes sure the lighting is safe and can be used anywhere indoor or covered outdoor. We included a battery pack in the box in case you want to use the lights portable, 3AA batteries could offer around 15 hours battery time, outdoor. Rechargeable battery is recommended 【Stone of Unconditional Love and Stress Release, An Excellent Meditative, Protection and Calming Stone 】Rose Quartz works in the emotional, spiritual, and physical planes to promote calm, balance, and peace. It’s also used to eliminate stress and protects against psychic attack, paranormal harm or ill-wishing, and returns the energy back to the universe after being transformed into positive, loving energy. 【 Multi-Function Remote with Timing and Flicker Functions】With battery pack, you can easily carry and place the LED lights anywhere you like (batteries not included). And control it with the multi-function remote. 2/6 Hrs build-in timer provides automatic shut off. (if you turn it on under 6 Hrs timer mode at 3 PM, it will turn off at 9 PM and on again at 3 PM the next day).Multiple flicker speeds and brightness levels are available with the controller.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iC8sYqYOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JASHIKA","source_asin":"B08T9534WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T9534WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T9534WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
