window.products.push({"id":409526,"name":"[Red Duffle Bag Storage Bag] - Christmas Tree Storage Bag for Artificial Trees up to 3 Feet Tall - Works Great for Garlands and Seasonal Decorations -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EY42WxgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"So, you’ve added a few decorations this year to your Christmas treasures. Sadly, your storage space isn’t growing with your precious possessions. We have all been there. It’s becoming less and less reasonable to simply place garlands, nutcrackers, and other decorations on storage shelves. Leaving decorations exposed to bugs, dust, and mice shortens their lifespan, not to mention it’s hard to keep track of where you’ve placed them all. The Multi-Use Storage Bag is here for you! This bag is made to carry any of your small, large, or unwieldy decorations. You can fit your large garland and cradle your plastic snowmen and your wooden Noel sign inside its artificial branches. We understand that you don’t want to forget your boxed nativity set is tucked into the bag’s bottom corner, so we've added an ID tag window on the front of the bag to place a list of the bag’s contents. This duffel-style storage bag is easy to carry with it's reinforced carrying handles. The durable polyester fabric is also easy to clean between uses. Keep your expanding collection of decorations, or whatever you choose to store, together and safe all year round.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EY42WxgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Santa's Bags","source_asin":"B07VMP7WGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409526","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VMP7WGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VMP7WGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
