window.products.push({"id":409573,"name":"Azadx Clear Shoe Storage Organizer Stackable 6 Pack, Plastic Shoe Box with Front Door and Ventilation Back, Innovative Shoe Rack Organizer for Closet ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZD9nh4tKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What you will benefit from our plastic storage bins:  ● Great Storage Space: There are lock buttons on the top of each storage container so that it is stackable and stable. You can pile these stackable storage bins as you like to save more space.  ● Multifunctional Storage Organizers: They are more than shoe boxes. Our storage boxes are also ideal to hold your small daily essentials, cosmetics, clothing, toys and other articles that you want to put in a dust-proof or water proof space.  ● Fashion Decoration: Our clear storage boxes can be fashionable decor while being storage containers and display racks.   ●●FQA●● ● What are the dimensions of each shoe box?  -Medium size: 13.1'' x 9'' x 5.5'' / Depth x W x H; X-Large size: 14.2'' x 11'' x 8.3'' / Depth x W x H.   ● Which size of shoes can these shoe organizers hold?  -The Medium size shoe storage boxes fit for Women's shoes up to 9.5, for Men's shoes up to 8.5.  Ideal for: Low-top Shoes, Running Shoes, Flat Shoes, etc.  -The X-Large boxes fit for Women's shoes up to 15, for Men's shoes up to 14.  Ideal for: High-heels, Low to Medium Top Shoes, Ankle Boots, Running Shoes. May not suit for high top shoes.   ● Are these storage containers sturdy enough?  --Yes, strong ABS frame + soft plastic body make our shoe boxes sturdy yet lightweight. Warm Tips: Please make sure the tabs and grooves are well aligned when stacking the bins.   ● Do these shoe bins need assembly?  --Yes, only few steps to do, and we also upload videos on this page for your reference. Warm Tips:  1. Reverse fold the plastic body to form it into a square;  2. Lips must be folded inside tightly before inserted into frame slot. You will hear a \"click\" sound when they are well assembled. Do that one corner at a time;  3. Our storage boxes are stackable, so make sure the tabs are on the top side (grooves on the bottom side).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZD9nh4tKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Azadx","source_asin":"B08YYJFWN6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YYJFWN6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YYJFWN6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
