window.products.push({"id":409880,"name":"Pauwer Bathroom Rugs Sets 3 Piece with Toilet Cover, Bath Mats for Bathroom Non Slip, U-Shaped Contour Toilet Mat, Absorbent Bath Mat Set, Machine Was","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815YlVm7SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bathroom Rug Sets 3 Piece: Crafted from upgraded polypropylene material, the 20\"x32\" bath rug, 20\"x24\" u-shape contoured rug help soothe tired feet and keep your toes warm on the cold floor, and the 15\"x18\" toilet lid cover provides protection to your toilet lid from scratches. Absorbent Bathroom Rug Mats: Soft polypropylene pile helps soak up a lot of water and keep your floor dry when you're stepping out of the bath, shower or getting ready by the sink, moisture is trapped in the bathroom rug’s deep pile to dry your feet quickly and avoid the dripping water disturbing your bathroom's serenity and tidy. Non-slip Shower Mats for Bathroom: Anti-slip bottom is made of high quality TPR material. This anti-skid rubber backing helps keeping the bathroom mat firmly in place, that it won't slip or slide, protect your families. Please make sure to place rugs on dry smooth floor only. Machine Washable & Non-Shedding: Simply machine wash in cold water with detergent and hang to dry or air dry flat, for a quick clean, simply vacuum with a hand-held cleaner or shake off outside. With premium fiber locking technology so that the bath mats for bathroom will not shed during using or washing. Multi Purpose: Pauwer non-slip bathroom mats is suitable for any place in your home where you want support and relax on your toes! We provide extensive selection of colors and sizes makes it easy to match your bathroom, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kids bathroom, guest suite decor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815YlVm7SLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pauwer","source_asin":"B08THRC5V5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THRC5V5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THRC5V5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409881,"name":"Draft Decor Draft Stopper Direct Vent Fireplace Termination Cap Cover #2 Trapezoid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4164GhevYuL._AC_.jpg","description":"Saving you money year-round! Made in USA Guard your house against extreme temperatures and humidity entering though the termination cap of your direct vent fireplace. Our Termination Cap Cover is the perfect solution! Our cap cover is a double-sided, multi-layered industrialized-strength, lightweight solid (non-breathable vapor barrier) aluminum radiant barrier approximately 6.5 mils in thickness that reflects (blocks) 97% of the radiant heat that strikes its surface! We use radiant barrier foil and insulation products which are beneficial in ANY application where the goal is to CONTROL HEAT. When placed between a source of heat and an area you wish to keep cool, the surface of our radiant barrier material reflects 97% of the radiant heat energy back towards the heat source keeping the intended area cooler. That's a significant amount of protection against unwanted heat gain in the summer and unwanted heat loss in the winter and results in lowered monthly utility bills. Overtime, these monetary savings add up and continue to provide energy savings for years to come. It is non-toxic, non-carcinogenic, fiber-free and is not affected by moisture or humidity. It is Class A/Class 1 fire rated and made is the USA. Lower your heating & cooling bills year-round! It's easy to install and easy to remove when you use your fireplace. MADE IN USA Enclosed with each Termination Cap Cover is a wire tie on NO FIRE tag to be put on your pilot light. This is to be attached when you install the Termination Cap Cover and will alert any person lighting the pilot that the cover is still on. Houses still need to breathe a bit. Our cover is not a 100% seal. But it will definitely stop warm air in the summer and cold air in the winter. - NO FIRES, NO PILOT LIGHTS WHEN TERMINATION CAP COVER IS IN PLACE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4164GhevYuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Draft Decor","source_asin":"B00YVB9D2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YVB9D2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YVB9D2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
