window.products.push({"id":409891,"name":"OWENIE Odette Velvet Curtain Panels - Extra Long Super Soft & Warm Velvet Textured Total Blackout Drapes, Thermal Insulated Window Privacy Blinds for ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kOZICy+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nice Warm Material: The velvet curtains are made from a luxurious and elegant polyester fabric. Velvet is a type of woven fabric that has a dense pile, which gives it a plush and soft texture. The fabric has a rich and deep color that gives it a sophisticated and opulent appearance. It has a subtle sheen that catches the light and adds dimension to the fabric's texture. Absolutely Blackout Effect: Extreme Blackout Thermal Lining soft to the touch, firm and durable, blocks out 100% of outside light and UV. Blackout curtains for bedroom not only offer you a real dark environment, bringing you a good night's sleep during the day, but also enhancing your sleep quality, wellness and comfort. Thermal Insulated: Velvet is known for its insulating properties, which make it an excellent choice for blackout curtains that help to keep out drafts and reduce noise. Keep the heat out and even keeps the room warmer when it's cold outside, providing a cozy atmosphere throughout the year. Energy Efficient design reduces energy lost through your windows by up to 40%. Noise reduction by up to 30% helps you get more uninterrupted sleep. Package Includes: Sold per pair including 2 panels. Curtain panel measures 52\" wide x 108\" long | Set measures 104\" wide x 108\" long. There are 3 hanging styles to choose from: back tab loops, rod pocket or with your own clip-rings for your personalized style. The curtains blackout is available in a range of colors, so you can easily find a shade that complements your decor. The velvet curtain is a luxurious and timeless choice that brings a sense of sophistication to your home. Easy Care: Machine washable in cold water, mild detergent no bleaching, use a gentle circle and tumble dry on a low setting. The window curtains for bedroom may be creases due to packing and storage which can be pressed by light ironing or steaming.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kOZICy+nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OWENIE","source_asin":"B0C49NV1W9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409891","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C49NV1W9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C49NV1W9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
