window.products.push({"id":409958,"name":"Artificial Ficus Tree, 72 Inches Tall - Fake Floor Plant for Modern Home Decor - Living Room, Bedroom, Balcony - Faux Potted Trees for Indoor or Outdo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817wmALV0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Realistic Appearance: Faux plants make beautiful decorative pieces, but when they look fake, they aren’t as visually pleasing. We found a gap in the market and that’s why we set out to create an artificial ficus tree that looks real. Textured real look branches, silk leaves and tropical foliage at the base, have all been used to enhance the natural look. Nature's Beauty Without The Maintenance: Nature gave us beautiful greenery, but keeping up with all the pruning and watering can be a hassle. With our tall faux floor plant, you can enjoy the sight of greenery, without the extra maintenance. Decorate Any Room with Greenery: Our faux ficus tree plant and seagrass pot compliments just about any setting. Place it next to a table or desk in your living room, bedroom, or office. Our trees also make great decorative pieces for restaurants. DELTE Reliable Quality: Unlike other fake plants that tend to fade and gather dust easily, we designed our ficus tree with quality. The base is 50% HEAVIER and WIDER than our competitors to aid with stability to prevent the tree from falling over. Included is a FREE BONUS, beautifully hand-woven sea grass basket with handles so it’s easy to transport. Versatile Decor – Use Indoors or Outdoors: Our artificial ficus tree is built for versatility. You can keep it indoors or outdoors. Easily place it inside for a party or gathering, then place it on a backyard patio or a balcony to set a tropical tone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817wmALV0IL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Casa Meva","source_asin":"B08BC3F3Z1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BC3F3Z1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BC3F3Z1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":409959,"name":"Wire Baskets for Storage Pantry, Set of 3 Metal Wire Baskets with Chalkboard for Storage Shelves, Black Wire Basket with Wooden Handles, Farmhouse Org","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGNv7YP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍀 【 Flexible Use in 3 Sizes 】Our wire baskets in 3 different sizes, can be flexibly worked in various size space, and create a customer organization system that works for you to keep items organized and neat. 🍀 【 Perfect Storage Way 】The black wire baskets provide a great storage solution for any room in the home. Versatile and practical. Lotions & towel organizers in your bathroom, food containers in your kitchen, mail or file holders in your office, etc. 🍀 【 Wooden Handles for Portable 】The wire storage baskets feature easy-carry wooden handles with soft silicone protection strip that make it simple to take and will not hurt your hands. 🍀 【 Unique Chalkboard Design 】Our metal wire baskets with chalkboard, you can mark with chalk to help you label your items. Even you can write on some blessings for your friends when the metal wire bins as a gift. 🍀 【 Hollow-carved Design 】The simple hollow-carved design of the storage baskets not only allows you to quickly find the items you want, but also ensures the air circulation around and keeps your stored items fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yGNv7YP6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ECOCONUT","source_asin":"B09MFDB4CY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-409959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MFDB4CY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MFDB4CY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
